<!-- ════════════════ 55 · 30-DAY ROLLOUT ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="30-day rollout" class="slide light" style="--c: #0d9488;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">55</span>Getting started</p>
      <h2 class="h2">A <span class="accent">30-day plan</span> to roll this out to your team.</h2>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="picks">
        <div class="pick">
          <div class="pk-n" style="color: #0d9488;">01</div>
          <h3>Week 1: measure and document</h3>
          <p>Log your current token spend and response times as a baseline. Add an instruction file to each active project so every prompt starts clean.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pick">
          <div class="pk-n" style="color: #0d9488;">02</div>
          <h3>Weeks 2-3: structure and habits</h3>
          <p>Refactor one oversized module into smaller, single-purpose files and measure the token drop. Adopt plan-before-code on a real task, and pick the model deliberately: small by default, top tier only where it earns its cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pick">
          <div class="pk-n" style="color: #0d9488;">03</div>
          <h3>Week 4: standardize and share</h3>
          <p>Agree team defaults (a rule file, plan-first, the model picker). Share the before-and-after numbers with the team, then pick the next module to improve.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "55" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "56" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
